---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Privacy Policy - Video Cursor Tracker | Blind Pixels Studio</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for Video Cursor Tracker desktop app by Blind Pixels Studio." />
	</head>
	<body class="page">
		<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
		<div class="layout">
			<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
				<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to home</a>
			</nav>
			<main id="main">
				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Video Cursor Tracker</p>
				</header>

				<section class="content-section">
					<p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 17, {currentYear}</p>

					<h2>Overview</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker is a desktop application for Windows that highlights the cursor in videos, 
						making it easier to see during tutorials, meetings, and recordings. We are committed to protecting 
						your privacy and being transparent about our practices.
					</p>

					<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
					<h3>Information We Don't Collect</h3>
					<p>
						<strong>Video Cursor Tracker does not collect, store, or transmit any personal information.</strong> The app:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Does not require you to create an account</li>
						<li>Does not collect your name, email, or contact information</li>
						<li>Does not track your location</li>
						<li>Does not access your camera, microphone, or files (except videos you explicitly open)</li>
						<li>Does not collect device identifiers or advertising IDs</li>
						<li>Does not send telemetry or usage data</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>Video Processing</h3>
					<p>
						The app processes video files that you choose to open. All video processing happens locally on your 
						Windows computer. Your videos and cursor tracking data:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Are processed entirely on your local machine</li>
						<li>Are never uploaded to any server or cloud service</li>
						<li>Remain under your complete control</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>File Access</h3>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker only accesses video files that you explicitly select through the app's file picker. 
						The app does not scan, access, or monitor any other files or folders on your computer.
					</p>

					<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. 
						The app operates completely offline and independently on your computer.
					</p>

					<h2>Internet Connectivity</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker does not require an internet connection to function. The app may check for updates 
						when an internet connection is available, but no personal or usage data is transmitted during this process.
					</p>

					<h2>Data Security</h2>
					<p>
						Since no data leaves your computer, your information remains secure on your Windows device. We recommend 
						following standard security practices:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Keep your Windows operating system updated</li>
						<li>Use antivirus software</li>
						<li>Protect your computer with a password</li>
						<li>Be cautious about where you download the app from (always use official sources)</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Permissions</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker may request the following Windows permissions:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>File system access:</strong> To read video files you select and save processed videos</li>
						<li><strong>Video decoding:</strong> To analyze and process video frames</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						These permissions are used solely for the app's core functionality and not for data collection.
					</p>

					<h2>Updates</h2>
					<p>
						The app may check for updates to provide bug fixes and new features. Update checks do not transmit 
						any personal or usage information. You can disable automatic update checks in the app settings if you prefer.
					</p>

					<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children under 13. 
						The app is safe for all ages as it does not collect or transmit any personal data.
					</p>

					<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
					<p>
						If we make changes to this privacy policy, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. 
						Significant changes will be communicated through the app's update notes or on our website.
					</p>

					<h2>Open Source</h2>
					<p>
						Video Cursor Tracker's source code may be available for review. You can verify our privacy claims by 
						examining the code yourself or having a trusted developer review it.
					</p>

					<h2>Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about this privacy policy or Video Cursor Tracker, please contact us at:
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@blindpixelsstudio.com">support@blindpixelsstudio.com</a>
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>
			<footer class="footer">
				<p>&copy; {currentYear} Blind Pixels Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
				<div class="footer__links" aria-label="Secondary navigation">
					<a href="/contact">Contact</a>
					<a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
	<style lang="css">
		:root {
			color-scheme: dark;
			font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
			background-color: #07090f;
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}

		body.page {
			margin: 0;
			min-height: 100svh;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #14213d 0%, #07090f 60%);
		}

		.skip-link {
			position: absolute;
			left: 50%;
			transform: translate(-50%, -200%);
			padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
			background: #f1f5ff;
			color: #111827;
			text-decoration: none;
			border-radius: 999px;
			transition: transform 0.2s ease;
			z-index: 10;
		}

		.skip-link:focus {
			transform: translate(-50%, 20%);
		}

		.layout {
			width: min(1080px, 100% - 3rem);
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 4rem 0 6.25rem;
		}

		.back-link {
			display: inline-block;
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: none;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.back-link:hover,
		.back-link:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.page-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f1f5ff, #93c5fd);
			-webkit-background-clip: text;
			-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			background-clip: text;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			color: #93c5fd;
			margin: 0;
		}

		.content-section {
			background: rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.4);
			border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.1);
			border-radius: 1rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.last-updated {
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			margin-top: 0;
			font-style: italic;
		}

		.content-section h2 {
			color: #f1f5ff;
			font-size: 1.75rem;
			margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
		}

		.content-section h2:first-of-type {
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section h3 {
			color: #93c5fd;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
		}

		.content-section p {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section ul {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section li {
			margin: 0.5rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: underline;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.content-section a:hover,
		.content-section a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.content-section strong {
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		.footer {
			margin-top: auto;
			padding-top: 4rem;
			text-align: center;
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}

		.footer__links {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 1.5rem;
			margin-top: 1rem;
		}

		.footer__links a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: none;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.footer__links a:hover,
		.footer__links a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 2.25rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}

			.content-section {
				padding: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h2 {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h3 {
				font-size: 1.125rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</html>
